# Docs snippets come from examples

Application code in `docs/content/` (and the matching Chinese pages) must be
copied from a runnable file under `examples/`. Do not invent Client, Worker,
Step, RPC, or HTTP APIs in docs.

Each snippet page must link to that example path. If the example exposes HTTP,
also link the examples playground (`examples/playground`) when the sample is in
the playground catalog.

If the API does not exist yet, add the example first, then copy the snippet.
